    {
      "source": "Returns the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\"><code>MethodInterceptor</code></a> to be used for the given source object and target type.",
      "translation": "返回用于给定源对象和目标类型的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\"><code>MethodInterceptor</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the current factory is supposed to be used to create a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\"><code>MethodInterceptor</code></a> for proxy of the\ngiven target type.",
      "translation": "返回当前工厂是否应该用于为给定目标类型创建代理的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\"><code>MethodInterceptor</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>source</code> - will never be null.",
      "translation": "<code>source</code> 永远不会为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>targetType</code> - will never be null.",
      "translation": "<code>targetType</code> 永远不会为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
