    {
      "source": "SPI to create <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\"><code>MethodInterceptor</code></a> instances based on the given source object and the target type to produce. To\nbe registered with a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/projection/ProxyProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProxyProjectionFactory</code></a> to customize the way method executions on projection proxies are\nhandled.",
      "translation": "SPI 用于根据给定的源对象和目标类型创建 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\"><code>MethodInterceptor</code></a> 实例，以便将其注册到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/projection/ProxyProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProxyProjectionFactory</code></a> 中，从而自定义投影代理上方法执行的处理方式。",
      "count": 1
    },
